You haven't brought --

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:56.483
you haven't brought nuts into --
-We have maybe a nut milk.

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:59.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
But the, you know, full sundae
-Oh, yeah.

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:01.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
The almonds have taken over.
-You know, the ice cream.

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:03.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
