-Always, since I was a kid

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was a total history buff
Completely obsessed.

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:23.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'd always wanted to go,
and I got the chance to do it.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:25.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
