to get there.

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:27.580
You have to get a million shots.
-Okay.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There has to be like nothin
physically wrong with you

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:32.619
because there's not much kind of
medical stuff down there.

00:02:32.619 --> 00:02:35.088 size:78% position:39%
It's a whole process,
but it was amazing.

00:02:35.088 --> 00:02:38.358 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was like a pilgrimage,
you know?

00:02:38.358 --> 00:02:41.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think it's safe to say
it's freezing, freezing cold

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:42.662 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's so cold.
-Okay.

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:44.931 size:84% position:42%
-So cold. And it's like
the height of summer.

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:46.232 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know?
It's as warm as it gets.

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:49.235
-But it's also --
This obviously also makes sense,

00:02:49.235 --> 00:02:53.039
