00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:07.086 align:start size:94% position:6%
but you are also --
a little bit of the inspiratio

00:03:07.086 --> 00:03:08.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
came from Antarctica.
-Yeah.

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:12.492
I just, like, I -- you know, the
